; Bait for the local-alias resolution case: a foreign compilation unit named
; [Base], planted on the resolver's cmi path. A resolver that treats a local
; alias's [Pident] head as a persistent unit reads this cmi and resolves to
; a foreign identity. Nothing links this library; the test names its cmi.

(library
 (name fix_foreign)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules base))
